&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;4:1-4:21;91-111&quot;&gt;About the Product&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;5:1-5:312;112-423&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure File Gateway&lt;/strong&gt; is a gateway that sits between a WAF and the web app backend. It ensures every uploaded file is scanned and sanitized by MetaDefender Core (via ICAP) before reaching the application; no WAF config changes needed. This solves the gap left by WAFs that don&#39;t support ICAP, or can&#39;t handle CDR-sanitized data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;9:1-9:18;537-554&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
