&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;10:1-10:115;555-669&quot;&gt;Design, build, and test SFG in &lt;strong&gt;C++ or Rust&lt;/strong&gt; (Windows/Linux) as the transparent proxy between WAF and backend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-11:151;670-820&quot;&gt;Implement the core flow: intercept uploads → forward to MetaDefender Core over ICAP → return sanitized files, with low latency and high reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;12:1-12:64;821-884&quot;&gt;Build multi-threaded, high-concurrency networking components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;13:1-13:126;885-1010&quot;&gt;Build and use &lt;strong&gt;agentic workflows&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., Claude Code, autonomous coding agents) daily for coding, testing, and debugging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;14:1-14:87;1011-1097&quot;&gt;Work within a Scrum team; collaborate with Product Management; do peer code reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
