&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;acronym-highlight&quot;&gt;OPSWAT&lt;/span&gt;, a global leader in IT, &lt;span class=&quot;acronym-highlight&quot;&gt;OT&lt;/span&gt;, and &lt;span class=&quot;acronym-highlight&quot;&gt;ICS&lt;/span&gt; critical infrastructure cybersecurity, delivers an end-to-end platform that gives public and private sector organizations and enterprises the critical advantage needed to protect their complex networks, secure their devices, and ensure compliance. Over the last 20 years our commitment to innovative technology has earned the trust of more than 1,700 organizations, governments, and institutions globally, solidifying our role in protecting the world’s critical infrastructure and securing our way of life.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, business-owner product leadership role, not a pure strategy or coordination seat. An experienced product manager reports to you, with full people responsibility, and dedicated cloud engineering teams partner with you daily. You operate like a general manager, fluent in packaging, pricing models, and metering, and conversant in NDR and GDR. You understand the whole business, from sales enablement and marketing through inbound and digital motion to field events and channel partners, and hold every investment to a strong ROI. You also carry the platform responsibility everything else depends on: performance, availability, migration, and cost. You bring an AI-first mindset, leveraging AI in the day-to-day work of the team to maximize efficiency and output.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;s15&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;Join a pre-IPO, global cybersecurity leader at the forefront of innovation. We protect the unseen — the infrastructure that powers our way of life. OPSWAT protects the world’s critical infrastructure across IT, OT, and ICS environments, trusted by more than 2,000 organizations, governments, and institutions worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;s15&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;We are seeking an exceptional product leader to own the vision, strategy, and execution of MetaDefender Cloud, the verdict as an API. Enterprises, governments, and technology partners send it files and get back a decision they can trust (“is this file safe to admit?”) at any volume. This is business ownership of a trust-critical enterprise cloud: the commercial ladder from self-serve developer entry to a top tier for regulated buyers, and everything that makes it credible, from contractual SLAs, availability, and failover to compliance, cost efficiency, and a platform other OPSWAT services build on. You will grow the business through product-led motion, cloud marketplaces, distribution channels, and a Technology Partners program that makes joining our ecosystem a product action, not a sales project.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;s15&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;s15&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;MetaDefender Cloud delivers OPSWAT’s prevention technologies (multiscanning, Deep CDR, and AI-driven analysis) as a cloud service, and is the shared platform behind a growing family of OPSWAT cloud offerings. This role owns that business end to end:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s16&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s10&quot;&gt;The Prevention Ladder:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;one coherent tier ladder from self-serve developer entry to full enterprise, sold to one buyer who moves up as throughput and analysis depth grow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s16&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s10&quot;&gt;The Regulated Enterprise:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;the top of the ladder: dedicated capacity, the strictest SLAs, large-file support, and a strict data-privacy and data-handling posture for regulated industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s16&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s10&quot;&gt;A Resilient, Compliant Cloud:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;reliability as a product, with availability targets, failover, recovery objectives, multi-region resilience, and certifications such as ISO 27001 and SOC 2 that make trust a reason to buy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s16&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s10&quot;&gt;The Platform Behind OPSWAT’s Cloud Services:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;one API and platform that web proxy and ICAP protection, MetaDefender Secure Storage, email security, MetaDefender for Salesforce, and the threat-hunting tier build on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s16&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s10&quot;&gt;Performance &amp;amp; Cost Efficiency:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;industry-leading speed to verdict, and a cost-per-scan discipline that protects margin as volume grows. You own the unit economics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s16&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s10&quot;&gt;Technology Partners &amp;amp; Developer Ecosystem:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;the program for engine partners who strengthen detection, integration partners who put our verdict where security teams work, and developers who build it into their own products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s16&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s10&quot;&gt;Marketplaces &amp;amp; Distribution:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;taking the product where buyers already purchase: cloud marketplaces such as AWS and Azure, distribution channels, and reseller partners, plus new offerings, such as MetaDefender Private for dedicated deployments, as the market demands.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s16&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s10&quot;&gt;Own the business:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;define and champion the vision, strategy, and roadmap for MetaDefender Cloud, and be accountable for growth, adoption, and commercial outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s16&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s10&quot;&gt;Own reliability as a product:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;make contractual SLAs (latency, availability, and recovery objectives) the standard across every tier, and drive high availability, automatic failover, and multi-region resilience from roadmap to contract.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s16&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s10&quot;&gt;Own compliance &amp;amp; regulation:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;maintain and extend our certifications (ISO 27001, SOC 2, and beyond) and the data-privacy and data-residency posture, so regulated buyers can say yes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s16&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s10&quot;&gt;Run the platform for its stakeholders:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;treat the OPSWAT services built on the cloud (web proxy and ICAP, secure storage, email, Salesforce, threat hunting) as first-class customers, balancing their needs with one coherent platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s16&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s10&quot;&gt;Own pricing &amp;amp; packaging:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;design and maintain the prevention tier ladder, packaging, metering, and discount guidance, steward the one price book with your Aether counterpart, and monitor realization against list.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s16&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s10&quot;&gt;Drive cost efficiency:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;own cost per scan and the margin story, and make efficiency a continuous, measured program.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s16&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s10&quot;&gt;Lead the platform evolution:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;carry customers through major platform transitions, with migration paths that never ask them to break their integration, and retire legacy offerings cleanly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s16&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s10&quot;&gt;Grow marketplaces &amp;amp; distribution:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;list the product on the cloud marketplaces where buyers already purchase, grow channel and reseller partnerships, and build the no-touch motion behind them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s16&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s10&quot;&gt;Build the Technology Partners program:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;make joining the ecosystem a product action, with SDKs, API documentation, and automated onboarding and vetting, so every engine, integration, and developer partner adds detection, reach, or data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s16&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s10&quot;&gt;Champion product-led growth:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;the product sells the product. Own every self-serve and paid-conversion motion, including from the free community, plus the inbound and digital funnels and the upgrade path.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s16&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s10&quot;&gt;Tailor the experience to the persona:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;know the cloud architect, platform engineer, and enterprise security leader in financial services, SaaS, and technology, and shape onboarding, console, and API experiences around their daily work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
