&lt;div class=&quot;s17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s16&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s10&quot;&gt;Monitor the business:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;track the KPIs that matter (tier mix, NDR and GDR, realization, platform performance, unit cost) and use them to steer investment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
