&lt;div class=&quot;s17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s16&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s10&quot;&gt;Communicate with stakeholders:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;clearly articulate strategy, progress, and results to internal teams, executive leadership, and customers, fostering alignment and enthusiasm.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
