&lt;div class=&quot;s17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s16&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s10&quot;&gt;Exceptional communicator:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;outstanding interpersonal and executive communication skills, enabling collaboration across cross-functional teams and credibility with customers and leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
