&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;acronym-highlight&quot;&gt;OPSWAT&lt;/span&gt;, a global leader in IT, &lt;span class=&quot;acronym-highlight&quot;&gt;OT&lt;/span&gt;, and &lt;span class=&quot;acronym-highlight&quot;&gt;ICS&lt;/span&gt; critical infrastructure cybersecurity, delivers an end-to-end platform that gives public and private sector organizations and enterprises the critical advantage needed to protect their complex networks, secure their devices, and ensure compliance. Over the last 20 years our commitment to innovative technology has earned the trust of more than 1,700 organizations, governments, and institutions globally, solidifying our role in protecting the world’s critical infrastructure and securing our way of life.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;build and lead the small founding team — engineers and data scientists — behind something genuinely hard: high-throughput services that inspect live traffic at near-zero latency, and&amp;nbsp;applied&amp;nbsp;ML that runs in the critical path.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;re&amp;nbsp;here from person one, which means you&amp;nbsp;don&#39;t&amp;nbsp;inherit a culture or a bar — you set them. Who you hire and how they work is the product&#39;s first and most important architecture decision.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This is a player-coach role with&amp;nbsp;real&amp;nbsp;surface area.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;re&amp;nbsp;close enough to the systems and the models to earn your team&#39;s trust, and you own the thing that matters most: whether this team ships, and whether what it ships holds up in production. Small team, huge leverage, nowhere to hide — in the best way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;AI-native leadership. Non-negotiable.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You&amp;nbsp;don&#39;t&amp;nbsp;just use AI yourself — you build, hire, and coach a team that&amp;nbsp;operates&amp;nbsp;at 10x with it, and you hold that bar. Demonstrable AI&amp;nbsp;proficiency&amp;nbsp;is a hard requirement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16707816,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335572071&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335572072&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335572073&amp;quot;:16110523,&amp;quot;335572075&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335572076&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335572077&amp;quot;:16110523,&amp;quot;335572079&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335572080&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335572081&amp;quot;:16110523,&amp;quot;335572083&amp;quot;:24,&amp;quot;335572084&amp;quot;:10,&amp;quot;335572085&amp;quot;:15429407,&amp;quot;469789798&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;single&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469789802&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;single&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469789806&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;single&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469789810&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;single&amp;quot;}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW47643185 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW47643185 BCX0&quot;&gt;You own your team&#39;s outcomes end to end — what it delivers, how healthy it is in production, and how fast its people grow. You set technical and cultural direction alongside your lead engineers, make the calls that unblock rather than bottleneck, and own the hiring bar from the first req to the tenth. When the path is undefined,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW47643185 BCX0&quot;&gt;you&#39;re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW47643185 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;the one who creates clarity and a plan; when it ships,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW47643185 BCX0&quot;&gt;you&#39;re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW47643185 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;accountable for it behaving exactly as intended, not just passing in staging.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW47643185 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You lead from the front — hands-on enough that strong engineers respect your judgment, secure enough to let them fully own their work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You hire relentlessly and hold a high bar, and&amp;nbsp;you&#39;d&amp;nbsp;rather leave a seat open than fill it with &quot;good enough.&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You grow people — you turn strong individual contributors into force multipliers, and you measure yourself by what your team ships without you in the room.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You own the result, not the excuse — you take responsibility for delivery and for what runs in production, and you create clarity where there was ambiguity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&quot;Good enough&quot; makes you uncomfortable, for the product and for the team&amp;nbsp;you&#39;re&amp;nbsp;building.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;What You Bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Proven, demonstrable AI-native leadership — you personally&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;at 10x with AI, and you build, hire, and coach a team that does the same, making AI&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;a standard rather than an experiment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;8-10+ years in engineering, including real time leading teams that shipped and operated production systems people depended on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Genuine technical depth — you came up through building, and you can still go deep on systems, ML, or both, well enough to guide hard calls and review the work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;A track record&amp;nbsp;of hiring and growing high-performing engineers and data scientists, and of setting a&amp;nbsp;bar&amp;nbsp;a team is proud to clear.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The ability to own delivery of an ambiguous, high-stakes charter&amp;nbsp;end&amp;nbsp;to end without trading away quality or the production bar.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;OPSWAT is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to providing an environment where equal employment opportunities are extended to all employees and applicants, free of discrimination and harassment of any type. All employment decisions are based on individual qualifications, job requirements, and business needs without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other category protected by federal, state, or local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recruiting Agencies: we do not accept unsolicited resumes from third party agencies for any of our open positions. To submit resumes for our jobs, there must be a recruiting contract approved by our legal team and endorsed by both parties. We are currently not accepting additional 3rd party agencies at this time.&lt;/p&gt;
