&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&#39;re&amp;nbsp;assembling a small founding team to build something genuinely hard: high-throughput services that inspect live traffic,&amp;nbsp;terminate&amp;nbsp;and analyze TLS in the data path, and hold near-zero latency while doing it. This is real systems engineering — streaming, distributed, latency-obsessed — not another CRUD app behind a form.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You&amp;nbsp;won&#39;t&amp;nbsp;be starting cold. You inherit real infrastructure and real users, which means what you build reaches production in weeks, not years. The work is high-leverage from day one, and&amp;nbsp;there&#39;s&amp;nbsp;nowhere to hide — in the best way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;AI-native. Non-negotiable.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;AI to&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;as a 10x engineer — demonstrable AI&amp;nbsp;proficiency&amp;nbsp;is a hard requirement, not a nice-to-have.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16707816,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335572071&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335572072&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335572073&amp;quot;:16110523,&amp;quot;335572075&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335572076&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335572077&amp;quot;:16110523,&amp;quot;335572079&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335572080&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335572081&amp;quot;:16110523,&amp;quot;335572083&amp;quot;:24,&amp;quot;335572084&amp;quot;:10,&amp;quot;335572085&amp;quot;:15429407,&amp;quot;469789798&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;single&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469789802&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;single&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469789806&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;single&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469789810&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;single&amp;quot;}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW155431012 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW155431012 BCX0&quot;&gt;You take a capability from a rough idea all the way to production, and then you keep it alive and healthy there — meeting its latency and reliability targets, instrumented well enough to prove it, and hardened to survive real load and real failure. You own the outcome, not the ticket.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW155431012 BCX0&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW155431012 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;lead a functional area end to end: set its technical direction, make the calls that matter, and pull other engineers along with you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW155431012 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You see what needs to&amp;nbsp;exist&amp;nbsp;and you&amp;nbsp;go build&amp;nbsp;it — you spot the gap, scope it yourself, and start, instead of waiting for someone to hand you a task or a spec.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You lead by taking the hardest, least-defined part of the problem and making it work, and others follow because your judgment and output earn it — not because of a title.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You own the entire arc — design, build, ship,&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;— and you treat what happens in production as your responsibility, making sure the system behaves exactly within the parameters&amp;nbsp;it&#39;s&amp;nbsp;supposed to, not just that it passed in staging.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;When you hit the edge of what you know — a protocol&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ve&amp;nbsp;never touched, a failure mode&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ve&amp;nbsp;never seen — curiosity and sheer grit carry you across it faster than most people expect.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&quot;Good enough&quot; makes you uncomfortable; you hold a high bar for yourself and ship work&amp;nbsp;you&#39;re&amp;nbsp;genuinely proud to put your name on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;What You Bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Proven, demonstrable proficiency using AI as a force multiplier — you already operate as a 10x engineer, orchestrating AI tools and agents to design, build, and ship far beyond what you could alone, while keeping the judgment to know what &quot;correct&quot;&amp;nbsp;actually looks&amp;nbsp;like.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;5–7+ years building and operating production services and front ends, with&amp;nbsp;real experience&amp;nbsp;owning something end to end and carrying the weight of it once&amp;nbsp;it&#39;s&amp;nbsp;in front of real users.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with TLS / MITM inspection and the security-sensitive edge cases that come with sitting in the middle of live traffic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;A real&amp;nbsp;track record&amp;nbsp;of taming latency in streaming and distributed systems —&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ve&amp;nbsp;chased down p99 tail latency and know that &quot;fast on my machine&quot; means nothing until&amp;nbsp;it&#39;s&amp;nbsp;fast in production, under load, with observability to back it up.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Strong command of a modern backend language (Go, Rust, or TypeScript/Node) and React/TypeScript on the front end, with a deep working grasp of HTTP, TLS,&amp;nbsp;gRPC/REST, and async/streaming I/O.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;OPSWAT is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to providing an environment where equal employment opportunities are extended to all employees and applicants, free of discrimination and harassment of any type. All employment decisions are based on individual qualifications, job requirements, and business needs without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other category protected by federal, state, or local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recruiting Agencies: we do not accept unsolicited resumes from third party agencies for any of our open positions. To submit resumes for our jobs, there must be a recruiting contract approved by our legal team and endorsed by both parties. We are currently not accepting additional 3rd party agencies at this time.&lt;/p&gt;
