&lt;li&gt;Maintain compliance with industry standards and regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor processes for efficiency and suggest improvements where necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all fulfillment activities are documented accurately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve any issues related to hardware fulfillment promptly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
