&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of individual hardware components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;understanding of hardware imaging and QA/QC processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving skills and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work under pressure and meet tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational and multitasking skills.&lt;/li&gt;
