&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW189623822 BCX9&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW189623822 BCX9&quot;&gt;We are looking for a driven and passionate &lt;strong&gt;Machine Learning Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW189623822 BCX9&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW189623822 BCX9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;who&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;will own the data foundation the team runs on:&amp;nbsp;dataset pipelines, labeling workflows, and data quality. Model quality is bottlenecked by data quality; this role removes that bottleneck. &lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We&#39;ve had a strong presence in Veszprém for over a decade, and we&#39;re now expanding into Budapest, this role is based in our newly opening Budapest office, right at the start of that growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will Have the Opportunity to&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train and fine-tune models against curated datasets; run systematic hyperparameter and architecture experiments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain evaluation suites: regression tests for model behavior, benchmark tracking across model versions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze model failures (false positives/negatives) and translate findings into dataset or training improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package models with documentation, benchmarks, and reproducible evaluation results for Engine team handoff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to internal tooling for experiment tracking and model comparison&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years ML engineering or applied data science experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Python; hands-on experience with modern training and fine-tuning workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with structured model evaluation (not just accuracy, precision/recall tradeoffs, drift, edge-case analysis)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working against defined acceptance criteria and production constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
