&lt;li&gt;Build production-ready systems that are scalable, secure, observable, and maintainable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Analytics &amp;amp; Decision Support&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
