&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We believe our Designers should be thinking, designing, discussing on issues that affect the quality of the products, and not spending excessive time in meetings. Time spent on Usability and Design is key to diving deep, discovering insights, and directing that knowledge into improvements in products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
