&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are designers at heart, we share cool discoveries, learn from each other, ask for opinions, we provide feedback, and are stronger together. We are a global team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
