&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Product Design team is part of the Product Management Team. We provide critical insight and actionable materials for product development, we work closely with key divisions including Management, R&amp;amp;D, QA, and Release teams. We have extended relationships with other key teams including Brand, Marketing, and Customer Experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
