&lt;h3&gt;The Position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Software Development Engineer in Test Intern &lt;/strong&gt;plays an important role in assuring the quality of the OESIS Framework OPSWAT&#39;s technology for detecting, assessing, and managing endpoint applications. As a member of the team, you will be involved in every stage of the software development life cycle, gain hands-on experience testing real cybersecurity products, and be exposed to how the team is adopting AI tools to make testing faster and smarter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write/review detailed test cases and perform testing based on requirements and documents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze/review product documents and requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build and maintain automated test scripts using Robot Framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and apply AI-assisted tools to improve test case design, test coverage, and defect analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle support escalation such as creating reproducible bug reports or helping troubleshoot.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report/manage defects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Need From You&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently pursuing or recently completed a BSc in Computer Science, Technology, or a similar field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in software testing with a good QA mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic exposure to testing concepts such as manual testing and functional testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with scripting languages such as Python or JavaScript, enough to help write manual test cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of different Operating Systems (Windows, Linux) and browsers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to learn and work within an Agile team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good reading and writing skills in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;It Would Be Nice If You Have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Robot Framework, JIRA, TeamCity, Git.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about or hands-on experience using AI tools (e.g., Copilot, ChatGPT, Claude) to support testing, scripting, or documentation work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to advanced testing types such as integration testing, usability testing, compatibility testing, performance testing, security testing, or regression testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in the cybersecurity domain, including file security, device security, or network security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of networking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ISTQB certification (or working toward one).&lt;/li&gt;
