&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re seeking an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Technical Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to drive adoption and growth across OPSWAT&#39;s product portfolio, protecting the systems the world depends on. You&#39;ll bring a strong grasp of the cybersecurity landscape and a track record of accelerating product adoption and a builder&#39;s mindset for applying AI and agentic AI to make our products smarter and our own workflows faster. You&#39;ll work at the intersection of system architecture, security, and enterprise integration, collaborating with senior stakeholders across Vietnam and the U.S.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product strategy and roadmap for your assigned OPSWAT products, aligning it with customer needs, market dynamics, and business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive customer adoption and engagement, optimizing the end-to-end experience to reduce friction and increase value for enterprise users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify where AI and agentic AI can strengthen the product, automating workflows, surfacing insights, and enabling new capabilities and translate these into concrete roadmap items.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct competitive analysis and market research to shape product direction and differentiate our offering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define product positioning and messaging, partnering with marketing and sales on go-to-market strategies, launch plans, and enablement tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering, UX, and QA to deliver secure, scalable, high-impact enhancements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use customer feedback and usage data to identify growth opportunities, guide decisions, and track key metrics for product success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the voice of the customer, ensuring enterprise-grade security, compliance, and usability drive product decisions and represent the product in strategic customer conversations, analyst briefings, and industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Need From You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales-Oriented Mindset: You have proven experience supporting sales teams and helping close complex deals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise &amp;amp; Public Sector Experience: You are comfortable and effective when working with large companies and government clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, Versatile Communication: You can easily explain technical concepts to business leaders and business needs to technical teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compelling Content Creation: You are skilled at creating persuasive materials for various audiences, from executive summaries to customer-facing guides.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Partnership Development: You have a track record of building successful partnerships (e.g., Channel, OEM) to expand market reach.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core Product Management Skills: You have a solid foundation with 5+ years of direct experience in a product management role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cybersecurity Industry Knowledge: You possess a strong understanding of the B2B cybersecurity market and its challenges.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Sets You Apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform-first thinking: experience with products that are part of a larger, integrated platform, with a natural instinct for how they connect into a unified offering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-native builder: you actively experiment with agentic AI to prototype, automate, and accelerate and you push your team to do the same.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, innovative spirit: always improving the product, the user experience, and staying ahead of market trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global perspective: experience working with international customers and teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why OPSWAT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At OPSWAT, we&#39;re not just building products. we&#39;re protecting the systems the world depends on. Our solutions are among the fastest-growing in critical infrastructure protection, and this is your chance to help lead their future alongside a global, elite technology team that values innovation, impact, and integrity. If you&#39;re ready to lead, mentor, and build secure software that matters powered by the latest in AI;&amp;nbsp; let&#39;s make it happen, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
